# A small, purpose-built fixture for docs/screenshots.rst's Autocomplete
# screenshot (issue #3746). Deliberately synthetic, not an excerpt of real
# translator work: unit 0's target seeds AutoCompletor's word list with
# "vertaalbaar" (Afrikaans "translatable" - the target language here is
# Afrikaans, so the completed word needs to actually be Afrikaans, long
# enough to be a usable suggestion - see AutoCompletor.isusable()); unit
# 1's target already has valid text typed - generate_docs_screenshots.py
# positions the cursor at its end and types "vert" there to trigger the
# suggestion, showing a translator continuing a partial translation, not
# starting from an empty field.
